{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"secret","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A JSON-escaped multiline holdout can expose a short later line to the reviewing agent."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Common code lines in a multiline holdout can obscure unrelated changes and cause a reviewer to miss defects."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A very large diagnostic history causes repeated event-loop delays while paging, without a demonstrated incorrect result or outage."}]}